>> Dier := Objekt nĳ.
>> Fabryk := Objekt nĳ.

Dier by: ['nĳ'] dwaan: {
	>> dier := sels nĳ.
	dier sound: ['?']. <- dier.
}.

Dier by: ['sound:'] dwaan: { :s
	eigen lûd := s.
}.

Dier by: ['lûd'] dwaan: { <- eigen lûd.
}.

>> Hûn := Objekt nĳ.
>> Kat := Objekt nĳ.

Hûn by: ['nĳ'] dwaan: { <- Dier nĳ sound: ['woof!'].
}.

Kat by: ['nĳ'] dwaan: { <- Dier nĳ sound: ['meow!'].
}.

Utfier skriuwe: Hûn nĳ lûd, nije-rigel.
Utfier skriuwe: Kat nĳ lûd, nije-rigel.

Fabryk by: ['mingje:en:'] dwaan: { :bist1 :bist2 <- Dier nĳ sound: (
		( bist1 lûd fan: 0 lingte: 2 ) +
		( bist2 lûd fan: 2 lingte: 5 )
	).
}.

Utfier skriuwe: (Fabryk mingje: Hûn nĳ en: Kat nĳ) lûd, nije-rigel.
